cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: ModelPNPS.jl
abstract: >-
  High-fidelity forward modelling of PNPS (Parametrized Nonlinear Process
  Spectrum) pulse-characterisation traces by full spatially-resolved nonlinear
  propagation. Given an analytic or measured input pulse and an experimental
  geometry, it produces the trace a real apparatus would record — including
  spatial beam overlap, mode shape, mask edges, chromatic vignetting, material
  dispersion, phase matching and the full nonlinear response. The implemented
  process is TG-FROG (Transient-Grating FROG).
type: software
